   "item_score": "989",
   "id": "33493",
   "item_level": "989",
   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 1353785,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 5132,
    "poster_id": 652,
    "post_rendered": "Notice that if you consider the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/62527e5b7449c67c85154b82589cdf0910dad7ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ h(x) = f(x) - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" > because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f392c23dd74e27d6e51bd8ebd239249d19c16b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" > is non-decreasing we have the inequality<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd9c4025d973a6e938b91ba3173dfabe54a0fe37.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ h(x + 1) - h(x)\\geq - 1\n\\]\"  width=\"168\" height=\"18\" ><br>\nSo when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a08f71942ed14e0db141f8543314098d350e76a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ g(a) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" > , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a89ce6af158c34e073d1dd4996f4d169864320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ g(b &lt; 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" > then there will be a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b95aeee5197d9cdcb23d6210f3ef5079dbcc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ c\\in[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" > s.t. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/23309ea2f638762d61cf58d7f37908ac8849d81b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ g(c) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" > which proves the lemma.",
    "post_canonical": "Notice that if you consider the function $ h(x) \\equal{} f(x) \\minus{} x$ because $ f$ is non-decreasing we have the inequality\r\n\\[ h(x \\plus{} 1) \\minus{} h(x)\\geq \\minus{} 1\r\n\\]\r\nSo when $ g(a) > 0$ , $ g(b < 0)$ then there will be a $ c\\in[a,b]$ s.t. $ g(c) \\equal{} 0$ which proves the lemma.",
    "username": "Omid Hatami",
    "post_number": 10,
